  "solution": "Given:\n\n2 [(54 × 17 × 54 × 17) ÷ (2(sqrt{289div 2}))² ]\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f6a6f51084aefde02b91ba47863bfac1061c599c8385d17e0ff4f3f9e051a6a8.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n2 [(54 × 17 × 54 × 17) ÷ (2(sqrt{289div 2}))² ]\n\n⇒ 2[54 × 17 × 54 × 17) ÷ (2× (17)/(sqrt2))² ]\n\n⇒ 2[54 × 17 × 54 × 17) ÷ (sqrt2 × 17)² ]\n\n⇒ 2[54 × 17 × 54 × 17) ÷ 2 × 17 × 17]\n\n⇒ 54 × 54\n\n**⇒ 2916**\n\n**∴ Option 2 is the correct answer.**",
